Build the public Career Page and Job Listing Card for Rankora at /Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Rankora.

**Agent: Koda** — You're building the candidate-facing public career page.

## File 1: Create `src/components/career/JobListingCard.tsx`

A presentational card for a single job on the career page.

```tsx
interface JobListingCardProps {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  location: string | null;
  department: string | null;
  employmentType: string | null;
  salaryRange: string | null;
  createdAt: string;
  brandColor: string;
  onApply: (jobId: string) => void;
}
```

Design:
- Card with hover shadow transition
- Title (text-lg font-semibold)
- Metadata row: MapPin icon + location, Building2 + department, Clock + employment type, DollarSign + salary
- Only show metadata items that have values
- Relative time badge (e.g., "Posted 3 days ago") using formatDistanceToNow from date-fns
- "Apply Now" button styled with brandColor as background
- Use `cn()` from lib/utils, Button from shadcn

## File 2: Create `src/pages/CareerPage.tsx`

Public route at `/careers/:slug`. NO auth required. NO sidebar.

Read `src/pages/Apply.tsx` for the public page pattern (standalone header + footer, no SidebarLayout).

Structure:
```
div.min-h-screen.bg-background.flex.flex-col
  // Header
  header.sticky.top-0.z-10.bg-background/95.backdrop-blur.border-b
    div.max-w-4xl.mx-auto.px-4.py-4.flex.items-center.gap-3
      {config.logo_url && <img src={logo_url} className="h-8 w-8 rounded object-cover" />}
      span.font-semibold.text-lg {config.company_name}

  // Hero section (colored by brand_color)
  div.py-12.px-4 (style={{ backgroundColor: brandColor + '10' }})
    div.max-w-4xl.mx-auto.text-center
      h1.text-3xl.font-bold {config.company_name}
      {config.tagline && <p.text-lg.text-muted-foreground.mt-2>{tagline}</p>}
      {config.about && <p.text-sm.text-muted-foreground.mt-4.max-w-2xl.mx-auto>{about}</p>}
      Badge "{jobs.length} Open Positions"

  // Department filter
  {departments.length > 1 && (
    div.max-w-4xl.mx-auto.px-4.py-4.flex.gap-2.flex-wrap
      button "All" (active state)
      {departments.map(dept => <button>{dept}</button>)}
  )}

  // Job listings
  main.flex-1.max-w-4xl.mx-auto.px-4.py-6.w-full
    {filteredJobs.length === 0 ? EmptyState : (
      div.grid.gap-4
        {filteredJobs.map(job => <JobListingCard ... onApply={handleApply} />)}
    )}

  // Footer
  footer.py-6.text-center
    "Powered by Rankora" link to /
```

Data fetching:
```typescript
const { slug } = useParams<{ slug: string }>();

const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ["career-page", slug],
  queryFn: async () => {
    if (!slug) return null;
    const { data, error } = await supabase.rpc("get_career_page", { p_slug: slug });
    if (error) throw error;
    return data as { config: CareerConfig; jobs: CareerJob[] } | null;
  },
  enabled: !!slug,
  staleTime: 60_000,
});
```

States:
1. Loading — skeleton cards
2. Not found — "Career page not found" with link to home
3. No jobs — "No open positions right now" message
4. Active — full page with jobs

Apply handler:
```typescript
const handleApply = (jobId: string) => {
  navigate(`/apply/${jobId}`);
};
```

